sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant AS as Authorization server
    participant API as API
    C->>C: Generate code_verifier and code_challenge
    C->>AS: Redirect to /authorize with client_id, redirect_uri, scope and code_challenge
    AS->>U: Login and consent
    U->>AS: Credentials
    AS->>C: Redirect to redirect_uri with a code
    C->>AS: POST /token with the code and the code_verifier
    AS->>AS: Check the code_verifier against the code_challenge
    AS->>C: access_token, refresh_token and id_token
    C->>API: Request with Bearer access_token
    API->>API: Validate signature, iss, aud and exp
    API->>C: Response
